}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
If there was an 2r chance of 1 crossover (so that each chromatid has a chance \
of r of having one crossover) and otherwise no recombination events, then \
bias will change this by an amount:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9913255906041403`*^9, 3.991325644618166*^9}, {
  3.991326173971485*^9, 
