Cell["order of CO placements matters", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99062320316704*^9, 3.990623207437269*^9}, 
   3.990623360439321*^9},ExpressionUUID->"a9cddeaa-5f37-4acb-a3cd-\
bfa0b82af7b6"],

Cell["\<\
consider two crossovers, with strand-configuration 1,3 and 2,3. the \
chromatids start out like so:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990559399766899*^9, 
  3.9905594159446087`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1c67780f-0676-42dc-99c3-\
a866864a41ed"],

